his was tested with a library of synthetic substrates and this activity is unsure in vivo (PubMed:19088067)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}